From 7299cf4214086416f6a9ec7e4fe4a56517dd517a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dammian Miller <dammian.miller@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Apr 2026 22:07:59 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] hybrid speculative: port rollback + checkpoint fixes to
 master

Port hybrid model speculative decoding support from feature/planarquant-kv:
- Add recurrent state checkpoint/restore system for SSM rollback
- Save R/S tensor state to CPU RAM before speculative batches
- Graceful fallback when partial seq_rm fails on hybrid models
- Fix checkpoint invalidation using pos_max > pos_next (#20671)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 common/speculative.cpp      |  72 +++++++++++--
 src/llama-memory-hybrid.cpp | 203 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/llama-memory-hybrid.h   |  18 ++++
 3 files changed, 283 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

